Subject: [PATCH v6 3/3] PCI: artpec6: Configure FTS with dwc helper function
Date:   Wed, 13 Nov 2019 15:21:22 +0800
Message-Id: <dc50f502926d3f1eb66a560042602d163872f053.1573613534.git.eswara.kota@linux.intel.com>
